# Conformance probe pack for `absent` on a `hex` field of at most 64 bits
# (spec 0.22: the sentinel is the field's `uint` raw value, not its hex text).
# Public. No kinds. Least significant bit first, where the hex text is not the
# wire's hex: raw value 15 (wire 0f) is the text "f0".
#
#   byte 0        label  two hex digits; raw value 15 means absent
format     conformance-long-hex-absent
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  lsb
field   probe.label  0:0:8  hex  absent 15
